00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:03.660
There may be occasions where you need
to send documents out to customers or

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:07.590
clients where they need to indicate
a preference for a specific item

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:09.510
or there maybe multiple choice.

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:13.770
To do this, within Word you have the
developer tab where you can create

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:15.870
check boxes or drop down lists.

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:20.100
In this video, I'm going to demonstrate
how you can add check boxes and drop

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.260
down lists to a preformatted template.

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:26.760
You can download these templates from
the page on the vision2learn website.

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.750
So the first thing I need to do is I
have my template open on the screen

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:35.160
and I'm going to add some check boxes
alongside each of these options.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:39.910
The first thing I need to do is to
make sure that my cursor is placed

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:44.250
at the point where I want to insert
the drop-down list or check boxes.

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:46.080
So I've moved along there.

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:50.280
I'm going to use the tab key just
to move it along one further,

00:00:50.310 --> 00:00:53.370
one space further, and then I'm
going to go to the developer tab.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:57.765
And when I'm on the developer
tab, there are a range of options.

00:00:57.765 --> 00:01:00.705
Now, the tools that we're looking
for is in the controls section.

00:01:01.275 --> 00:01:05.504
So if I click on the checkbox content
control and click that, it will

00:01:05.504 --> 00:01:08.625
insert a checkbox where the cursor is.

00:01:09.225 --> 00:01:15.935
I then need to duplicate that,
for the next checkbox, and again,

00:01:16.645 --> 00:01:18.695
use the tab key to line them up.

00:01:19.414 --> 00:01:22.615
Place my cursor there, press the
tab key till they're lined up.

00:01:24.655 --> 00:01:25.775
Down to the next option.

00:01:26.885 --> 00:01:28.179
Use the tab  key to line them up.

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:34.080
And finally add the last checkbox.

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:37.140
Now these boxes should work straight away.

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:39.900
So you should be able to
check or uncheck these boxes.

00:01:40.110 --> 00:01:42.720
So a customer could then
indicate their preferences.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:48.030
However, the document hasn't been
protected, so customers or anyone

00:01:48.030 --> 00:01:49.500
can actually edit the document.

00:01:51.525 --> 00:01:52.965
Which isn't recommended.

00:01:53.505 --> 00:01:57.195
So what we need to do to avoid that
is to actually protect the document.

00:01:57.615 --> 00:02:01.305
So if you look along the toolbar, you
can see the restrict, editing icon.

00:02:01.425 --> 00:02:06.845
And if I click on that, it brings up a
range of options on the right hand pane.

00:02:07.095 --> 00:02:09.824
So what I want to do is I
want to restrict the editing.

00:02:09.914 --> 00:02:12.780
So.,yes, it is filling in forms.

00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:15.120
So we want to allow customers,
or clients to fill in forms.

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:15.990
So that's correct.

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:18.990
And then select yes, start
enforcing protection.

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:23.370
So once I've clicked that it'll
ask me for a password and I will

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:30.710
just enter a password, click OK.

00:02:32.870 --> 00:02:41.989
So now when I come to edit the document, I
can check or uncheck the boxes but I will

00:02:41.989 --> 00:02:46.079
not be able to edit or make any changes.

00:02:46.739 --> 00:02:47.670
No matter what I try.

00:02:47.670 --> 00:02:48.900
I can't highlight anything.

00:02:48.959 --> 00:02:52.980
The only editable options within
the document are the check boxes.

00:02:55.095 --> 00:02:57.915
Now that you've learned how to create
check boxes, I'm going to demonstrate

00:02:57.915 --> 00:02:59.715
how you can insert drop down lists.

00:03:00.375 --> 00:03:03.465
As you can see, I'm using a very similar
template to the one used previously,

00:03:03.855 --> 00:03:06.975
the only difference being is that the
number of options have been reduced.

00:03:07.335 --> 00:03:11.235
The reason for this is that the drop
down list will contain the numbers of

00:03:11.235 --> 00:03:14.505
people who may be interested, which
the reader can then select from.

00:03:15.225 --> 00:03:18.015
So the first thing you need to do is
to make sure that I'm on the developer

00:03:18.015 --> 00:03:22.245
tab and make sure my cursor's in the
position where I wish the dropdown

00:03:22.245 --> 00:03:25.898
is to be placed use the tab key
for that, just to move it further

00:03:25.898 --> 00:03:29.638
along a little bit, and reduce that.

00:03:29.798 --> 00:03:35.138
And then from the controls bar,
I will then select a drop down

00:03:35.138 --> 00:03:39.398
list, content control that will
insert that first drop down list.

00:03:40.358 --> 00:03:44.588
I then need to do the same for
the next two dropdown lists.

00:03:47.448 --> 00:03:49.938
And that has inserted the three
dropdown lists as required.

00:03:52.108 --> 00:03:54.668
Now  that that drop down
list has been inserted.

00:03:54.788 --> 00:03:58.088
I need to populate them because as you
see, if I click on them, there's only

00:03:58.088 --> 00:04:01.508
one option in there, which is choose
an item which is placed in by default.

00:04:02.228 --> 00:04:04.808
So to do that, I'll click
on the first drop down list.

00:04:05.378 --> 00:04:09.458
And then I need to go up to the top and
select properties, the control properties,

00:04:09.548 --> 00:04:13.568
and that will open up the dialog box where
I can make changes to the dropdown list.

00:04:14.648 --> 00:04:16.118
The first thing I need
to do is give it a title.

00:04:16.948 --> 00:04:22.148
So I will type in there
"People who are interested".

00:04:23.483 --> 00:04:27.143
Now the next thing is that I need
to add some options to the dropdown.

00:04:27.293 --> 00:04:28.705
So the first thing to do is click add.

00:04:28.705 --> 00:04:29.083
I'm going to insert the
number one, add again.

00:04:29.083 --> 00:04:29.150
Add in the number two.

00:04:29.150 --> 00:04:29.175
Add again and the number three.

00:04:29.175 --> 00:04:33.240
Add again, the number four and
finally once more add and the

00:04:35.230 --> 00:04:46.940
number five and plus, click OK.

00:04:47.915 --> 00:04:51.935
So once I've done that, I can click
OK and that will then have populated

00:04:51.965 --> 00:04:59.645
the dropdown list with the options
to select from one to five plus.

00:05:01.115 --> 00:05:05.165
I then need to duplicate that for
the following two dropdown boxes.

00:05:05.165 --> 00:05:13.765
So again, select the second box,
select properties, give it the title.

00:05:17.765 --> 00:05:18.585
Click add.

00:05:20.055 --> 00:05:31.925
One, two, three, four, five plus.

00:05:32.875 --> 00:05:33.405
Click OK.

00:05:33.405 --> 00:05:46.810
And finally for the third dropdown,
select the properties, give it the

00:05:46.810 --> 00:05:50.080
title and then add the numbers.

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:04.500
Once that has been done, click OK.

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:07.420
So I now have all three
drop down lists populated.

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:14.470
As we can see they all work and people
who are reading the document can

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:17.110
make selections from the dropdowns.

00:06:18.450 --> 00:06:22.060
As with the checkbox document,
people can still edit this.

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:26.920
So again, what you would need to do
is to protect the document and click

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:31.600
on the restrict editing button, make
sure that it is set to allow only

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:35.260
this type of editing in the document,
which is filling in forms, and then

00:06:35.260 --> 00:06:37.390
select yes, start enforcing protection.

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:39.470
Add a password.

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:46.400
Click OK.

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:49.270
And that document is now protected.

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:56.620
While people can make changes from
the dropdown, nobody can make any

00:06:56.620 --> 00:06:58.720
changes to the rest of the document.

